WEBVTT

00:13:58.695 --> 00:14:02.172
microbes, particles,

00:14:02.172 --> 00:14:03.706
the amount of phi falls off.

00:14:03.706 --> 00:14:06.139
The amount of information integration falls off,

00:14:06.139 --> 00:14:07.587
but it's still non-zero.

00:14:07.587 --> 00:14:09.526
On Tononi's theory,

00:14:09.526 --> 00:14:11.733
there's still going to be a non-zero degree

00:14:11.733 --> 00:14:13.562
of consciousness.

00:14:13.562 --> 00:14:16.101
In effect, he's proposing a fundamental law

00:14:16.101 --> 00:14:19.485
of consciousness: high phi, high consciousness.

00:14:19.485 --> 00:14:22.107
Now, I don't know if this theory is right,

00:14:22.107 --> 00:14:25.318
but it's actually perhaps the leading theory right now

00:14:25.318 --> 00:14:26.704
in the science of consciousness,

00:14:26.704 --> 00:14:28.935
and it's been used to integrate a whole range

00:14:28.935 --> 00:14:31.322
of scientific data,